  "description": "<p class='problem-lead'>計算費波那契數列的第 N 項。</p><p>費波那契數列定義為：<code>F(1) = 1</code>，<code>F(2) = 1</code>，當 <code>n ≥ 3</code> 時 <code>F(n) = F(n-1) + F(n-2)</code>。請讀取正整數 <code>N</code>，輸出 <code>F(N)</code>。</p>",
  "hint": "<p>用兩個變數分別記錄前兩項，逐步往後推算到第 N 項，不需要用遞迴。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>一行，包含正整數 <code>N</code>。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>輸出一個整數，表示費波那契數列的第 <code>N</code> 項 <code>F(N)</code>。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>1 ≤ N ≤ 30</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "6",
  "sampleOutput": "8",
  "samples": [
    {"input": "1", "output": "1"},
    {"input": "6", "output": "8"},
